{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Horror Story: The Trailer Park</strong> is a psychological horror game set in an apparently abandoned trailer park. Players explore dark environments, uncover secrets, and experience tense moments designed to make them question what is real and what is not. The game emphasizes narrative, atmosphere, and player choice, creating an immersive and suspenseful experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Horror Story: The Trailer Park:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first chapter of <i>A Horror Story: The Trailer Park</i>, you play as a 23-year-old woman exploring a mysterious trailer park. Alone in this unsettling environment, she soon uncovers disturbing secrets that challenge her sanity. Will she survive the night and uncover the truth?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror experience with tense, immersive moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration of a mysterious trailer park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on player choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich atmospheric design with detailed environments and immersive audio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easter eggs and hints for future chapters</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028050?t=1768598018","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028050?t=1768598018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028050/71f65e826ac943f80496155e4f08debfc83c8a13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768598018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028050/71f65e826ac943f80496155e4f08debfc83c8a13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768598018","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}